.idea
*.iml
target/
**/target/
*.md
!prompt.md
docker-compose.yml
.DS_Store
# Runtime data + test artifacts — must never enter the build context. jraft_ledger/ holds the node
# RocksDB/raft/kafka/mysql volumes + diagnostics (tens of GB); shipping it made builds slow and caused
# stale-layer cache hits. None of this belongs in the image.
jraft_ledger/
logs/
loadtest/
k6-report-*.html
hs_err_pid*.log
*.dump
